@startuml
title VOPC - UC-06 Đăng nhập bằng tài khoản nội bộ

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Boundary/UI" {
  class "Authentication Web UI" as LoginUI <<boundary>> {
    +showLogin(returnTo)
    +loadLoginContext(returnTo)
    +submitCredentials(username, password)
    +showGenericError()
    +submitLogout(csrfToken)
  }
  class "Authentication API / Controller" as AuthAPI <<control>> {
    +signIn(username, password, returnTo)
    +signOut(sessionToken, csrfToken)
  }
  class "Authentication Middleware" as AuthMiddleware <<control>> {
    +authenticateRequest(sessionToken)
  }
  class "Local User CLI" as UserCLI <<boundary>> {
    +createLocalUser(username, displayName)
    +resetLocalPassword(username)
    +setLocalUserStatus(username, status)
  }
}

package "Application / Security" {
  class "Authentication Service" as AuthService <<control>> {
    +signIn(username, password, requestSource)
    +createLocalUser(username, displayName, password)
    +resetLocalPassword(username, password)
    +setLocalUserStatus(username, status)
  }
  class "Password Hasher" as PasswordHasher <<control>> {
    +hash(password)
    +verify(password, encodedHash)
    +needsRehash(encodedHash)
  }
  class "Session Manager" as SessionManager <<control>> {
    +createSession(userId)
    +authenticateRequest(token)
    +revokeCurrentSession(token)
    +revokeAllSessions(userId)
  }
  class "Login Rate Limiter" as RateLimiter <<control>> {
    +check(username, requestSource)
    +recordFailure(username, requestSource)
    +clearAccountFailures(username)
  }
  class "Principal" as Principal <<transient>> {
    +userId: UUID
    +username: String
    +displayName: String
  }
}

package "Persistence" {
  class "User Account Repository" as UserRepo <<entity>> {
    +createAccountAndCredential(account, credential)
    +findByNormalizedUsername(username)
    +findActiveAccount(userId)
    +replacePassword(userId, passwordHash)
    +setStatus(userId, status)
  }
  class "Auth Session Repository" as SessionRepo <<entity>> {
    +save(session)
    +findActiveByTokenHash(tokenHash)
    +touch(sessionId, lastSeenAt)
    +revoke(sessionId)
    +revokeAll(userId)
  }
  class "Login Attempt Repository" as AttemptRepo <<entity>> {
    +loadBuckets(accountKeyHash, sourceKeyHash)
    +recordFailure(bucket)
    +clearAccountBucket(accountKeyHash)
    +deleteExpiredBuckets()
  }
}

LoginUI --> AuthAPI
AuthAPI --> AuthService
AuthAPI --> SessionManager : logout
AuthMiddleware --> SessionManager
AuthMiddleware ..> Principal : attaches to request
UserCLI --> AuthService
AuthService --> PasswordHasher
AuthService --> SessionManager
AuthService --> RateLimiter
AuthService --> UserRepo
SessionManager --> SessionRepo
SessionManager --> UserRepo : account status
RateLimiter --> AttemptRepo

note right of Principal
  Chỉ tồn tại trong request context.
  UC-01 đến UC-05 dùng Principal,
  không phụ thuộc local credential.
end note

note right of SessionRepo
  Chỉ token hash và CSRF binding được lưu.
  Raw session token chỉ tồn tại trong cookie.
end note

@enduml
